WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.350
- Our choreographer's amazing.

00:00:01.350 --> 00:00:03.390
She's Jessica Castro, and she worked with

00:00:03.390 --> 00:00:05.610
Mariah Carey and Alicia Keys.

00:00:05.610 --> 00:00:06.683
- Never heard of them.

00:00:06.683 --> 00:00:07.589
(laughter)

00:00:07.589 --> 00:00:08.422
- Yeah, and J Lo.

00:00:08.422 --> 00:00:09.727
And she sat me down and she's like,

00:00:09.727 --> 00:00:12.300
"Look, you're playing a pop-star,

00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:14.060
you need to know about the hair whip."

00:00:14.060 --> 00:00:14.893
And I'm like,

00:00:14.893 --> 00:00:16.230
"Well, what do you mean 'the hair whip?'"

00:00:16.230 --> 00:00:17.063
And she said,

00:00:17.063 --> 00:00:18.900
"You have to fully
commit to the hair whip.

00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:22.380
All of these divas really
know how to whip their hair,

00:00:22.380 --> 00:00:24.630
and if you don't do it correctly,

00:00:24.630 --> 00:00:26.550
it will land in your face."

00:00:26.550 --> 00:00:29.349
So, you know, as she says there,

00:00:29.349 --> 00:00:32.040
you can't, you can't think side...

00:00:32.040 --> 00:00:33.660
I don't even know if
I can do it right now.

00:00:33.660 --> 00:00:36.270
You can't think side-to-side, okay JB?

00:00:36.270 --> 00:00:37.410
- You gotta swing up.

00:00:37.410 --> 00:00:39.660
- You gotta think, fall, fall.

00:00:39.660 --> 00:00:42.057
- Oh my God. See? See?

00:00:42.057 --> 00:00:43.950
- I was like, I don't
know if it's gonna work.

00:00:43.950 --> 00:00:45.927
- You are so natural at it though.

00:00:45.927 --> 00:00:48.124
(laughter)

00:00:48.124 --> 00:00:49.708
- That was good. You nailed it.

00:00:49.708 --> 00:00:50.910
(laughter and clapping)

00:00:50.910 --> 00:00:52.587
- Your hair is just blowing.

00:00:52.587 --> 00:00:54.116
- We'll put the hair in later.

00:00:54.116 --> 00:00:54.949
Put the hair in later.

00:00:54.949 --> 00:00:56.377
- Yeah, extensions. CGI.

00:00:56.377 --> 00:00:57.210
(laughter)

00:00:57.210 --> 00:00:58.350
- Oh my God, that was incredible.

00:00:58.350 --> 00:01:01.020
- Full disclosure, I was very very nervous

00:01:01.020 --> 00:01:02.730
and very intimidated about the singing.

00:01:02.730 --> 00:01:03.990
And now I just like play,

00:01:03.990 --> 00:01:05.190
you know how you have your,

00:01:05.190 --> 00:01:07.080
whatever your Rocky song is?

00:01:07.080 --> 00:01:07.913
And I was like,

00:01:07.913 --> 00:01:08.790
"What doesn't kill you makes you stronger."

00:01:08.790 --> 00:01:09.623
"What doesn't kill you-"

00:01:09.623 --> 00:01:10.640
- Oh my God.

00:01:10.640 --> 00:01:11.473
- And I was literally like,

00:01:11.473 --> 00:01:12.750
I can do this. I have three days.

00:01:12.750 --> 00:01:14.430
But if I just sing from the heart.

00:01:14.430 --> 00:01:15.263
And I'm like,

00:01:15.263 --> 00:01:16.650
what are you guys thinking voice wise?

00:01:16.650 --> 00:01:18.120
You know, like Kelly Clarkson.

00:01:18.120 --> 00:01:18.953
I'm like, whoa.

00:01:18.953 --> 00:01:22.680
You're thinking like, the
best singer of our generation.

00:01:22.680 --> 00:01:24.360
Not gonna happen in three days.

00:01:24.360 --> 00:01:25.193
But I'm gonna do my best-

00:01:25.193 --> 00:01:26.026
- Oh my God, you were so great.

00:01:26.026 --> 00:01:26.859
It was so great.

00:01:26.859 --> 00:01:27.692
- Yeah, so you were my muse

00:01:27.692 --> 00:01:28.525
and I just wanted you to know that.

00:01:28.525 --> 00:01:29.460
- You are very kind.

00:01:29.460 --> 00:01:30.860
You're always so nice to me.

